# 🚀 AI Resume Analyzer using Endee (RAG)

## 📌 Overview
Full-stack AI system using Endee vector database for semantic search and resume analysis.

## 🧠 Features
- Resume parsing (PDF)
- Embedding generation (384-dim)
- Vector storage using Endee
- Semantic search
- RAG-based AI response

## 🏗️ Tech Stack
- Node.js (Backend)
- React (Frontend)
- Endee (Vector DB)
- Sentence Transformers

## ⚙️ Endee Integration
- Created collection via API
- Stored embeddings
- Performed similarity search

## ▶️ Run

### Start Endee
cd endee  
./run.sh  

### Backend
cd backend  
npm install  
node server.js  

### Frontend
cd frontend  
npm install  
npm start  

## 🎯 Use Case
AI-powered resume screening using vector search and RAG.
